       <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"plan-price\">\n        <div class=\"now\">¥15<small>/月</small></div>\n        <div class=\"year\">按年付 ¥150/年</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"plan-card featured\">\n      <div class=\"plan-head\">\n        <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n        <div class=\"tagline\">综合体验首选</div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"plan-feats\">\n        <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n        <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n        <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n        <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n        <li>7×24 优先工单支持</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"plan-price\">\n        <div class=\"now\">¥35<small>/月</small></div>\n        <div class=\"year\">按年付 ¥350/年</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"plan-card\">\n      <div class=\"plan-head\">\n        <h3>团队版</h3>\n        <div class=\"tagline\">多人协作与企业用途</div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"plan-feats\">\n        <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n        <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n        <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n        <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n        <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"plan-price\">\n        <div class=\"now\">¥85<small>/月</small></div>\n        <div class=\"year\">按年付 ¥850/年</div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"usage-section\" id=\"usage\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">How to use</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">从开通到连接，四步走完。</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n        <h3>选择套餐</h3>\n        <p>在套餐列表中按设备数量和流量需求选择合适档位，提交订单完成付款。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n        <h3>获取订阅</h3>\n        <p>登录用户中心，复制专属订阅地址，或扫描页面提供的二维码备用。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n        <h3>导入客户端</h3>\n        <p>在对应平台客户端中选择\"导入订阅\"，粘贴地址或扫码，等待节点列表加载。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n        <h3>选择节点</h3>\n        <p>从列表中选择延迟较低的节点，点击连接。状态显示成功后即可正常使用。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"client-section\" id=\"clients\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Clients</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">主流平台均可使用，按设备选择客户端。</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"client-grid\">\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">Windows</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">支持 Windows 10 及以上系统</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">macOS</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">支持 Intel 与 Apple Silicon</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">Android</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">支持 Android 9 及以上版本</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">iOS</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">支持 iOS 15 及以上版本</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">Linux</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">提供命令行与图形界面版本</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"client-card\">\n        <div class=\"platform\">路由器</div>\n        <div class=\"desc\">兼容主流固件，需自行配置</div>\n        <span class=\"link\">详见用户中心</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"faq-section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">FAQ</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">把常被问到的事情，一次说清楚。</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <details>\n        <summary>流量用完了怎么办？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-answer\">套餐流量按月重置。如当月提前用尽